abstract: >-
  Self-hosted environmental, health and safety software for corporate teams,
  connecting incident reporting, corrective and preventive actions, audits,
  and safety reporting with role-based access and human approval.
  A separate GitHub Pages walkthrough presents synthetic, read-only data.
